p91axc.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8C%9C%E7%8C%9C%E5%92%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%B0%81%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b6/j3py87wvmgs4xq0hh8yf60y6fp91axc.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8C%9C%E7%8C%9C%E5%92%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%B0%81%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b6/j3py87wvmgs4xq0hh8yf60y6fp91axc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />猜猜咱是谁！\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>(反应) 受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]，触发时回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">100%</font>生命值，变身为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"小力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">小力</font></span></span>]，可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"立刻行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">立刻行动</font></span></span>]；下次行动开始时解除变身，冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89%E2%80%A2%E9%AD%94%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/贝拉•魔术师\"><img alt=\"头像 贝拉•魔术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/a0hndp63mq5sil1xz7x6f9ro1txplpl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=